---
import Layout from "@/layouts/main.astro"
---

<Layout title="Alfrin Poulose — Engineering Notebook" activeTab="home">
  <main class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto w-full px-6 md:px-8 py-12 md:py-24 space-y-24 md:space-y-32">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="grid-bg border border-[#262626] p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-16 corner-marks relative overflow-hidden bg-[#10131b]">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-[#10131b] pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="font-['Geist'] text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-[64px] md:leading-[72px] font-bold text-[#e0e2ed] mb-6 uppercase tracking-tight">
          ALFRIN POULOSE
        </h1>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mb-8 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#adc6ff] bg-[#0A0A0A] tracking-wider">SOFTWARE ENGINEER</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#c1c6d7] bg-[#0A0A0A] tracking-wider">AI</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#c1c6d7] bg-[#0A0A0A] tracking-wider">SYSTEMS</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#c1c6d7] bg-[#0A0A0A] tracking-wider">PERFORMANCE</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#c1c6d7] bg-[#0A0A0A] tracking-wider">OPEN SOURCE</span>
        </div>

        <p class="font-['Geist'] text-base md:text-[20px] md:leading-[32px] text-[#c1c6d7] mb-10 leading-relaxed">
          I build reliable, high-performance software systems. My core interest lies in understanding abstractions deeply—from the database engine up to distributed AI inference layers—and removing friction for other developers.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#e1e0ff] animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(225,224,255,0.6)]"></div>
          <span class="font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs text-[#c0c1ff] uppercase tracking-widest">
            Currently Exploring: Distributed Consensus & Hardware Acceleration
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Notebook Section -->
    <section class="space-y-10" id="notebook">
      <div class="border-b border-[#262626] pb-4 flex justify-between items-end">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-['Geist'] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-[#e0e2ed]">Notebook</h2>
          <p class="font-['Geist'] text-sm text-[#c1c6d7] mt-1">Technical deep-dives into computer systems, databases, and compilers.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="#notebook" class="font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs text-[#adc6ff] hover:text-[#4b8eff] transition-colors tracking-widest uppercase">
          VIEW ALL
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Post 01 -->
        <a href="/notebook/how-databases-find-data" class="block group">
          <article class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#0b0e16] p-6 sm:p-8 hover:border-[#414755] transition-all duration-300 corner-marks flex flex-col h-full group-hover:bg-[#181c23]/50">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs">
              <span class="text-[#c1c6d7]">POST / 01</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#adc6ff]/10 text-[#adc6ff] border border-[#adc6ff]/20 rounded-sm">NEW</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="font-['Geist'] text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#e0e2ed] group-hover:text-[#adc6ff] transition-colors leading-snug">
              HOW DOES A DATABASE ACTUALLY FIND YOUR DATA?
            </h3>
            
            <p class="font-['Geist'] text-sm text-[#c1c6d7] flex-grow mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              A deep dive into B-Trees, LSM Trees, and the underlying storage engines that power modern persistence layers. Understanding the mechanics beneath the abstraction.
            </p>
            
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#adc6ff] font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs mt-auto pt-2">
              <span>READ ENTRY</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </a>

        <!-- Post 02 -->
        <a href="/notebook/how-databases-find-data" class="block group">
          <article class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#0b0e16] p-6 sm:p-8 hover:border-[#414755] transition-all duration-300 corner-marks flex flex-col h-full group-hover:bg-[#181c23]/50">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs">
              <span class="text-[#c1c6d7]">POST / 02</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="font-['Geist'] text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#e0e2ed] group-hover:text-[#adc6ff] transition-colors leading-snug">
              REVERSE ENGINEERING A TOY COMPILER
            </h3>
            
            <p class="font-['Geist'] text-sm text-[#c1c6d7] flex-grow mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Breaking down the lexing, parsing, and code generation phases by building a minimal compiler from scratch in Rust. Learning through deconstruction.
            </p>
            
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#adc6ff] font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs mt-auto pt-2">
              <span>READ ENTRY</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects Section -->
    <section class="space-y-10" id="projects">
      <div class="border-b border-[#262626] pb-4">
        <h2 class="font-['Geist'] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-[#e0e2ed]">Selected Projects</h2>
        <p class="font-['Geist'] text-sm text-[#c1c6d7] mt-1">Production-ready open-source engines and system tools.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Showcase Project Card -->
      <div class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#181c23] corner-marks overflow-hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 shadow-xl">
        <!-- Left Content: Technical Description -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-[#262626]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs">
            <span class="text-[#adc6ff] bg-[#adc6ff]/10 px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#adc6ff]/20">PROJECT / 01</span>
            <div class="flex-grow h-[1px] bg-[#262626]"></div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-[#e0e2ed] tracking-tight uppercase">
            A High Performance LLM Inference Engine
          </h3>

          <p class="font-['Geist'] text-sm md:text-base text-[#c1c6d7] mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            A custom inference engine designed to optimize memory bandwidth and reduce latency for local LLM deployment. Built in C++ and CUDA to achieve 90%+ theoretical memory bandwidth utilization.
          </p>

          <!-- Key highlights -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs">
            <div class="p-3 bg-[#10131b] border border-[#262626]">
              <span class="text-[#8b90a0] block mb-1">LATENCY</span>
              <span class="text-[#adc6ff] font-bold text-sm">~45% REDUCTION</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-[#10131b] border border-[#262626]">
              <span class="text-[#8b90a0] block mb-1">THROUGHPUT</span>
              <span class="text-[#adc6ff] font-bold text-sm">3,200 TOK/SEC</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-10 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-[10px]">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#8b90a0] uppercase bg-[#0A0A0A]">C++</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#8b90a0] uppercase bg-[#0A0A0A]">CUDA</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#8b90a0] uppercase bg-[#0A0A0A]">PyTorch</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#8b90a0] uppercase bg-[#0A0A0A]">SIMD</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#262626] text-[#8b90a0] uppercase bg-[#0A0A0A]">KV CACHE</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-4 font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs">
            <a 
              href="/projects/llm-inference-engine" 
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 border border-[#adc6ff] bg-[#adc6ff]/10 text-[#adc6ff] hover:bg-[#adc6ff] hover:text-[#002e69] transition-all font-semibold"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">terminal</span>
              EXPLORE_PROJECT
            </a>
            <a 
              href="https://github.com" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 border border-[#262626] text-[#e0e2ed] hover:bg-[#31353d] transition-colors"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">code</span>
              SOURCE_CODE
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Content: Interactive Code Preview -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-[#0A0A0A] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between font-['JetBrains_Mono']">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[#262626] text-xs text-[#8b90a0]">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]"></span>
                kernel_fused_attention.cu
              </span>
              <span>CUDA v12.2</span>
            </div>

            <pre class="text-xs text-[#e0e2ed] overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed p-2"><code is:raw><span class="text-[#F97316]">__global__ void</span> <span class="text-[#adc6ff]">flash_attention_v2_kernel</span>(
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">const half</span>* <span class="text-[#F97316]">__restrict__</span> Q,
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">const half</span>* <span class="text-[#F97316]">__restrict__</span> K,
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">const half</span>* <span class="text-[#F97316]">__restrict__</span> V,
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">half</span>* <span class="text-[#F97316]">__restrict__</span> O,
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">const int</span> seq_len,
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">const int</span> head_dim
) {
    <span class="text-[#8b90a0]">// Shared memory allocations for tiling</span>
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">extern __shared__ half</span> s_mem[];
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">half</span>* s_Q = s_mem;
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">half</span>* s_K = &amp;s_mem[BLOCK_SIZE * head_dim];

    <span class="text-[#8b90a0]">// Grid-stride coalesced load into SRAM</span>
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">int</span> tid = threadIdx.x;
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">int</span> bid = blockIdx.x;
    ...
}</code></pre>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#262626] flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#8b90a0]">
            <span>Architecture: NVIDIA Ampere/Hopper</span>
            <span class="text-[#10B981]">Zero Copy Memory</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section class="space-y-8" id="about">
      <div class="border-b border-[#262626] pb-4">
        <h2 class="font-['Geist'] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-[#e0e2ed]">About & Approach</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#0b0e16] p-6 corner-marks">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-[#adc6ff]">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">memory</span>
            <h3 class="font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">Low-Level Mastery</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="font-['Geist'] text-sm text-[#c1c6d7] leading-relaxed">
            Understanding hardware characteristics—L1/L2 caches, register pressure, memory bandwidth—to write code that respects physical limits.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#0b0e16] p-6 corner-marks">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-[#adc6ff]">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">layers</span>
            <h3 class="font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">Clear Abstractions</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="font-['Geist'] text-sm text-[#c1c6d7] leading-relaxed">
            Designing APIs and architectures that conceal operational complexity while keeping high performance accessible to upstream users.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-[#262626] bg-[#0b0e16] p-6 corner-marks">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-[#adc6ff]">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">speed</span>
            <h3 class="font-['JetBrains_Mono'] text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">Empirical Profiling</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="font-['Geist'] text-sm text-[#c1c6d7] leading-relaxed">
            Never guessing performance bottlenecks. Driven by micro-benchmarks, trace analysis, flamegraphs, and hardware telemetry.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
